<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Allies</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Allied Powers</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Allies, or Allied Powers, were the coalition that fought the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/central-powers">Central Powers</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/first-world-war">First World War</a>, including <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/british-empire">British Empire</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russia">Russia</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> and later the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a>. Their victory in 1918 led to the dissolution of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austro-hungarian-empire">Austro-Hungarian Empire</a>. The peace treaties they imposed redrew the map of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/central-europe">Central Europe</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/allies.jpg" alt="Allies" width="320" height="390" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Childe Hassam · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Childe_Hassam_-_Allies_Day.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
